---
import { movie } from "../../../data/movie";

const project = movie.project;
---

<!-- Tarjeta informativa del proyecto -->
<div
    id="project-card"
    class="relative mt-20 w-full max-w-2xl text-left"
>
    <!-- Boton para expandir la informacion -->
    <button
        id="project-card-toggle"
        type="button"
        aria-expanded="false"
        class="group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between border border-doom-border-medium border-b-doom-green-transparent bg-doom-surface-soft p-4 text-left transition-[background,border-color] duration-300 hover:border-doom-green-hover hover:bg-doom-surface-green sm:px-6 sm:py-5"
    >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <span
                class="text-[8px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-doom-green"
            >
                {project.kicker}
            </span>

            <span
                class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em]"
            >
                {project.title}
            </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Icono de expansion -->
        <span
            id="project-card-icon"
            class="flex h-7.5 w-7.5 items-center justify-center border border-doom-border-light text-xl font-light transition-[transform,border-color] duration-300 group-hover:border-doom-green-border"
            aria-hidden="true"
        >
            +
        </span>
    </button>

    <!-- Contenido expandible -->
    <div
        id="project-card-content"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] overflow-hidden border-x border-doom-border-soft transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(.77,0,.18,1)]"
        aria-hidden="true"
    >
        <div
            class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden px-4 text-[0.8rem] leading-[1.8] text-doom-white-faded sm:px-6"
        >
            <div class="pt-6 pb-6">
                <p>
                    This website was created as a personal experiment driven by
                    curiosity, creativity and the desire to keep learning through
                    frontend development.
                </p>

                <p class="mt-4">
                    I wanted to explore animation, visual effects, responsive design,
                    interaction and storytelling through a fictional cinematic
                    experience. The project is made for fun and educational purposes,
                    with the intention of practicing and experimenting with web
                    technologies.
                </p>

                <p class="mt-4">
                    Part of the motivation behind this project came from seeing
                    creative frontend work such as the Spider-Man: Brand New Day
                    website created by MiduDev. That project inspired me to explore
                    how a website itself can become part of the cinematic experience,
                    rather than simply presenting information on a page.
                </p>

                <p class="mt-4">
                    This is an independent, non-commercial fan project. It is not
                    intended to represent, replace, imitate or claim ownership of any
                    official website, studio, publisher, character, logo, artwork,
                    trademark or other intellectual property belonging to their
                    respective owners.
                </p>

                <p class="mt-4">
                    Any referenced characters, names or visual concepts belong to
                    their respective copyright and trademark holders. This website is
                    presented solely as a personal exercise in design, development,
                    animation and learning.
                </p>

                <!-- Nota final del proyecto -->
                <div
                    class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-doom-border-soft pt-4 text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-doom-green"
                >
                    <span class="opacity-50">01</span>
                    <span>{project.note}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>